  - type: 7
    target: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 80c3f9a27f00d324680d999e67636f33, type: 2}
    qty: 5
  rewards:
  - type: 2
    target: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fde4bbabc08f90e4ca6a53d170041b39, type: 2}
    qty: 1
  - type: 1
    target: {fileID: 0}
    qty: 20
  offerLine: You. Yes, you. You're out at night, you've got a basket, you'll do. I need five crickets. Live ones, from the bush. It's for the Theory. Don't write this down.
  activeLine: Five crickets. They're listening to us, you know. So act natural.
  readyLine: Excellent. Excellent! The Theory holds. In return I'll give you my most secret recipe. I got it from a beetle. It tastes awful. That's how you know it's working.
  doneLine: Cook it. Don't taste it.
